# Cloudflare Pages response headers (copied into the site by mobile/tools/deploy-web.ps1).
# COOP + COEP make the page cross-origin isolated (crossOriginIsolated == true): SharedArrayBuffer, so the
# WebAssembly can run threads. Everything the page loads is same-origin, so require-corp blocks nothing.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
